# The secret files Alertmanager reads (ALERTMANAGER_SECRETS_DIR, mounted
# read-only at /etc/alertmanager/secrets): smtp_password, webhook_url,
# webhook_token. See docs/guides/deployment.md, section 7.
#
# Nothing in this directory is committed except this file, which exists so
# that the directory does, owned by you rather than created by Docker as root.
*
!.gitignore
